1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,560
One defender gives this whole play away.

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,010
He beats his man.

3
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,130
Here comes the help.

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,110
Freeze.

5
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,110
A, B, or C?

6
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,390
Two seconds.

7
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:13,110
A is the easy pass.

8
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,750
But his defender stayed home.

9
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,830
B? His defender is sitting in the passing lane.

10
00:00:18,019 --> 00:00:19,570
Now watch the low defender.

11
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,810
He left the corner to stop the drive.

12
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,090
That's the read. C.

13
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,110
Kick it.

14
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:28,130
The next rotation is a step too late.

15
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:29,730
Stop watching the ball.

16
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:30,790
Watch the help.

17
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,250
Got it in two seconds?

18
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,350
Run it back.

